crates/*/target_cod_*/
# Custom `--target-dir target_rch_*` invocations (review/audit pane targets).
# Mirror /target_rch_*/ at root (line 68) for any subdir. Without these,
# `cargo --target-dir target_rch_review` run from inside a crate or `src/`
# leaves a target tree that `git add -A` will happily stage — the exact
# failure class that needed two filter-repo passes (d8efc6b5, 5294ed2d).
crates/*/target_rch_*/
crates/*/src/target_rch_*/
**/target_rch_*/

