# rch remote-compilation helper caches with hyphenated names (worker-local cargo
# homes / target trees, e.g. .rch-cargo-home/, .rch-target/). The existing rch
# patterns above use underscores (.rch_*/, .rch_cargo_home_*/), so the hyphenated
# variants slipped through and were left untracked-but-visible; a `git add -A`
# could stage gigabytes of cache — the failure class that needed two filter-repo
# passes (d8efc6b5, 5294ed2d).
.rch-*/

# Agent patch/scratch buffers at root: .jh_<bead>.patch baseline/diff captures
# and .sandymeadow_* persona scratch (commit-message / class-module drafts).
# One-off per session, never canonical.
/.jh_*
/.sandymeadow_*

# Agent scratch & temporary probe tests under crates/franken-engine/tests/:
# compile-excluded staging buffers (leading underscore), one-off IR-dump
# diagnostics (*_irdump.rs), and zzz_-prefixed behavior probes meant to be read
# once then discarded. Kept on disk per AGENTS.md RULE 1 but never committed.
# Scoped to the zzz_ convention (not *_probe_*) so it cannot shadow real tests
# like observability_probe_design_integration.rs.
crates/franken-engine/tests/_*.rs
crates/franken-engine/tests/zzz_*.rs
crates/franken-engine/tests/*_irdump.rs

# Abandoned scratch modules: redundant with moonshot_weekly_report.rs and never
# registered in lib.rs. Listed by exact path because "moonshot" is a real domain
# prefix (moonshot_weekly_report, moonshot_disruption_track, ...).
/crates/franken-engine/src/moonshot_ranking_report.rs
/crates/franken-engine/tests/moonshot_ranking_report_integration.rs

# Compiler probe artifacts. `rustc --emit=llvm-ir` output left behind by one-off
# layout/size investigations (e.g. franken_sizecheck.ll, a 2026-07-15 probe of
# Value/Label enum sizes). These are never build inputs and are referenced
# nowhere in the tree. Ignored rather than deleted: AGENTS.md Rule 1 forbids
# removing files without explicit written user permission.
*.ll
# br doctor per-run artifacts
.doctor/
